OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption after signalling
OL,4,Afault
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo train services are able to pass
OL,7,Fthrough Birmingham Moor Street railway
OL,8,Fstation due to a fault with the
OL,9,Fstation's signalling system.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Railway said that
OL,12,Fservices between Birmingham Snow Hill
OL,13,Fand Dorridge, Whitlocks End, and
OL,14,FStratford-upon-Avon in both directions
OL,15,Fwere subject to delays, cancellation
OL,16,Fand alteration. Network Rail are on
OL,17,Fsite attempting to rectify the issue.
OL,19,FAccording to National Rail, disruption
OL,20,Fis expected until 11:00 GMT and trains
OL,21,Fcould face delays of up to 40 minutes
OL,22,Fif not cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
