OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption after signalling
OL,4,Afault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger on a train from Warwick to
OL,7,FBirmingham Moor Street told the BBC
OL,8,Fthat passengers had been informed the
OL,9,Ftrain would be making its way back to
OL,10,FLondon.
